# [[ .Name ]]

A [Quanarch](https://quanarch.org) quan. It cannot run on its own: it lives in a
quanar and reaches it only through the quas it declares in `src/index.ts`.

```sh
npm run dev                          # run inside the development quanar (dev/)
npm run build                        # build dist/index.js for a quanar
npm run deliver -- ../main           # copy the build into a quanar's public/quans
```

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/index.ts` | Declares the quan and the quas it uses. |
| `src/` | The quan itself. |
| `dev/` | The development quanar, with stand-in quas. |
| `scripts/deliver.mjs` | Delivers the build to a quanar that loads from `public/quans`. |
